{"id":"wb-8-663","name":"程潜公馆","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"程潜公馆","text":"程潜公馆，位于中国湖南省长沙市芙蓉区解放路街道办事处白果园23号，是中华民国一级上将程潜担任湖南省政府主席、长沙绥靖公署主任时的居所。\n据称1949年8月“湖南和平解放”过程中，程潜与中共代表在此秘密和谈。2015年时，以其设立湖南和平解放史事陈列馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A8%8B%E6%BD%9C%E5%85%AC%E9%A6%86","revisionId":94379189,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94379189","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/daaf3f02593d884976db18c5.jpg","title":"程潜公馆_20240506.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%A8%8B%E6%BD%9C%E5%85%AC%E9%A6%86_20240506.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/%E7%A8%8B%E6%BD%9C%E5%85%AC%E9%A6%86_20240506.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Uuongkinghe","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​程潜公馆，站在东南方向拍摄","width":320,"height":213}}